# Cast — the Chatters (chaos)
#
# Recruiters, a verified celebrity, a DJ who answers the room-wide blackout, a
# troll boss, and the social-media props that are the Chatters' natural
# habitat. Every scanner prop is a `ChatterScanner(beat)` (badge + router);
# props that carry a trust relationship keep it in their body.

CHARACTER Recruiter is ChatterScanner(recruit)

CHARACTER Verified_Vera is ChatterScanner(verified_meet)
  trusts Guest: 50 of 100

CHARACTER DJ is Chatter
  # A global cue, not an algorithmic punishment: the operator kills the lights
  # and the DJ rallies both public factions. `self`-only hook.
  on blackout
    <broadcast: lights_out to faction(Mods) | faction(Chatters)>

# Named performer: the troll boss who dares you into a ratio.
CHARACTER Troll_King is ChatterScanner(troll_dare)
  trusts Guest: 30 of 100

# Props: the giant Like button, the comment section, subscribe + notifications.
CHARACTER Like_Button is ChatterScanner(smash_like)
CHARACTER Comment_Section is ChatterScanner(comment_war)
CHARACTER Notification_Bell is ChatterScanner(subscribe)
